<title>USA: Safeskin gets FDA Clearance.</title>
<headline>Safeskin gets FDA Clearance.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Safeskin Corp said it received clearance on January 2 from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market a new powder free medical examination glove made of nitrile, a synthetic co-polymer that contains no natural rubber latex.</p>
<p>Safeskin's product introduction comes in response to the demand for synthetic glove products. This new glove is specifically designed to meet the needs of individuals who are sensitive to natural rubber latex, the company said..</p>
</text>
